A||||31||David Bartlett||Radar Detectors, Custom installs?||||1||
Z||000000||David Bartlett||11-17-2001||02:37 PM||||As with most of you, Radar Detectors aren't the most popular equipment as far as the police see it, so where do you guys put them? Any custom hiding spots?<P>I have a Bell, that I have dissembled, putting the led readout in the dash.. you know that empty space on the right side. It looks great but I've been running into problems with the wires being too long to power the led correctly. Sorry, its out of the car now so I can't post pics.<P>Just want to see what you guys are doing.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Monkeyman||11-17-2001||02:47 PM||||If I happen to move to Tx, I'll do a stealth Valentine installation.  (100 miles to the nearest big city.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> )||||reg||1
